# Focused MetalFX history-continuity check. Aiming and releasing the trigger
# smoothly animates GTA IV's projection; that motion must not discard temporal
# history every frame. Camera rotation keeps distant geometry, lights, and
# reflections moving while diagnostics record the continuity decision.
await 5m
wait 10s
nowanted
invincible
clock 21 0
weather 1
road 1040 150 20
wait 5s

mark fov_settled
trigger lt 1
stick rx 0.25 5s
release all
wait 2s
mark fov_aimed
stick rx -0.25 5s
release all
wait 2s
mark fov_released
quit
